  "name": "Mage Focus (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When the blue mage casts a spell with an area, as a free action, she may choose to focus the entire might of the spell on a single target. The spell's save DC is increased by +2, but only one target is affected by the spell. She may do this a number of times per day equal to 3 + her Intelligence modifier.</p><p><em>* This talent adds effects to a blue mage's spellcasting ability. Only one of these talents can be applied to an individual spell and the decision must be made before the spell is cast.</em></p>",
